  "title": "Southwestern Falafel",
  "description": "This is a spicy Southwestern twist on traditional falafel. Pinto beans are substituted for garbanzo beans, and spiked with cayenne powder, taco seasoning, and hot sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "jonvance"
  ],
